<title>INDIA: SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>Mahindra international squash tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Jonathan Power (Canada) 15-13</p>
<p>15-12 15-5</p>
<p>Paul Gregory (Greece) beat 5-Del Harris (England) 8-15 15-8</p>
<p>12-15 15-13 15-8</p>
<p>Mark Cairns (England) beat Omar El Borolossy (Egypt) 15-13</p>
<p>15-12 15-11</p>
<p>Derek Ryan (Ireland) beat Craig Wapnick (South Africa) 13-15</p>
<p>15-10 15-9 15-13</p>
</text>
